<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Encouraging Preach -->
  <DD_EncouragingPreach.stages.Encouraging_Preach.label>受到布道的鼓舞</DD_EncouragingPreach.stages.Encouraging_Preach.label>
  <!-- EN: Even though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death, I will fear no evil, for you are with me; your rod and your staff, they comfort me. -->
  <DD_EncouragingPreach.stages.Encouraging_Preach.description>我虽然行过死荫的幽谷，也不怕遭害。因为你与我同在。你的杖，你的竿，都安慰我。</DD_EncouragingPreach.stages.Encouraging_Preach.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Inspirational Preach -->
  <DD_InspirationalPreach.stages.Inspirational_Preach.label>醍醐灌顶的布道</DD_InspirationalPreach.stages.Inspirational_Preach.label>
  <!-- EN: Peace, love, and faith from the Lord the two-tailed rat to all the Ratkins! -->
  <DD_InspirationalPreach.stages.Inspirational_Preach.description>愿平安，仁爱，信心，从主圣双尾鼠，归与鼠众！</DD_InspirationalPreach.stages.Inspirational_Preach.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Terrible Preach -->
  <DD_TerriblePreach.stages.Terrible_Preach.label>糟糕的布道</DD_TerriblePreach.stages.Terrible_Preach.label>
  <!-- EN: That preaching was absolutely terrible; it was like heresy, a defilement of faith! -->
  <DD_TerriblePreach.stages.Terrible_Preach.description>那个布道讲的实在太糟糕了，简直就像是异端一样玷污信仰！</DD_TerriblePreach.stages.Terrible_Preach.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Uninspiring Preach -->
  <DD_UninspiringPreach.stages.Uninspiring_Preach.label>无聊的布道</DD_UninspiringPreach.stages.Uninspiring_Preach.label>
  <!-- EN: By the Holy Twin-Tail! Why should we waste our time listening to a silly preach? -->
  <DD_UninspiringPreach.stages.Uninspiring_Preach.description>圣双尾鼠在上！为什么我们要浪费时间去听一只呆头鼠讲话？</DD_UninspiringPreach.stages.Uninspiring_Preach.description>
  
</LanguageData>